{"segs": ["PA_ja_94:0.2", "PA_ja_94:0.3"], "en": "Ekakanipāta, Littavagga (The Chapter on the Small)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_94:0.4"], "en": "4. The Lomahaṃsa Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_94:1.1", "PA_ja_94:1.2"], "en": "Scorched by heat and parched with thirst, all alone in the terrifying forest;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_94:1.3"], "en": "“Naked, not sitting by the fire,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_94:1.4"], "en": "the sage is intent on his search.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_94:2.1"], "en": "Thus ends the fourth Jātaka, the Lomahaṃsa-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
